671b8693a9f34f","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"zhangle-q-o041","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-4ea9ede39bd95135199f","layer":"original","quote":"从征荆州，别屯樊，讨中庐、临沮、宜城贼〖7〗。又与满宠讨关羽于汉津〖8〗，与曹仁击周瑜于江陵。十五年〖9〗，讨太原反者，围大陵；拔之，斩贼帅商曜。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
